OL,3,GNEWSA'Obsessive' Billie Piper stalker
OL,4,Ajailed for 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "obsessive" fan with a "sexual
OL,7,Finterest" in Billie Piper has been
OL,8,Fjailed for 12 months for breaching a
OL,9,Fstalking prevention order designed to
OL,10,Fprotect the ex-pop singer and Doctor
OL,11,FWho star.
OL,13,FPhilip Jerome, of Winchester,
OL,14,FHampshire, appeared at Basingstoke
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court on his 49th birthday
OL,16,Fafter earlier pleading guilty to four
OL,17,Fbreach charges.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
